      "date": "2026-05-15T11:24:54.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹136 (up from ₹125 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹330.9b (up 6.8% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹91.2b (up 9.0% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 28% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 8.0%. Revenue is forecast to grow 15% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 17% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 15% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 42% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
