      "date": "2026-05-14T13:10:17.000Z",
      "title": "HAL: Defence Contracts And New Leadership Will Support Future Share Returns",
      "body": "Analysts have raised their fair value estimate for Hindustan Aeronautics to ₹5,161 from ₹5,107, reflecting updated assumptions on the stock's discount rate, long-term revenue growth, profit margin profile and expected future P/E multiple. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on May 14, 2026, at 10:00 Indian Standard Time to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, and other matters (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/capital-goods/nse-hal/hindustan-aeronautics-shares/53zk18pc-new-defense-orders-and-pipeline-will-drive-aerospace-modernization/updates/9-analysts-have-raised-their-fair-value-estimate-for-hindustan",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
